    "message": "fix(ecosystem): retain every required native audit artifact\n\n* fix(ecosystem): retain every required native audit artifact\n\nThe native container run uploaded tables while silently omitting its full report and process logs. Stage required files into one fresh relative directory and fail on missing or empty evidence before upload. Replay the actual staging shell on all package hosts; retain the incomplete run without promoting it.\n\n* test: read staging checks on CRLF checkouts",
